###GET all Invoices
GET http://localhost:4004/invoice/Invoices
Authorization: Basic shashi:shashi

###GET all Invoice Items
GET http://localhost:4004/invoice/LineItems

###GET particular Invoice Details
GET http://localhost:4004/invoice/Invoices/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006

###GET particular Invoice Line Item details
GET http://localhost:4004/invoice/Invoices/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/lineItems

###GET lineItems of specific invoice with expand
GET http://localhost:4004/invoice/Invoices/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004?$expand=lineItems

###GET all vendors
GET http://localhost:4004/invoice/Vendors

###GET metadata of all entities
GET http://localhost:4004/invoice/$metadata

###Insert a new record to the Invoice
POST http://localhost:4004/invoice/Invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "createdAt": null,
  "createdBy": null,
  "modifiedAt": null,
  "modifiedBy": null,
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2024-001",
  "invoiceDate": "2024-03-15",
  "dueDate": "2024-04-22",
  "grossAmount": "150000",
  "currency": "INR",
  "notes": "Laptop and accessories for new joiners",
  "vendor_ID": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "costCenter_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "status_code": "SB"
}

###Insert a new Line Item under the newly created Invoice
POST http://localhost:4004/invoice/Invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "createdAt": null,
  "createdBy": null,
  "modifiedAt": null,
